# Spotify integration (optional) — enables "Connect Spotify" for importing
# your playlists and albums (title, cover, tracklist). Without a Client ID the
# Spotify controls are hidden.
# Create an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard and register the
# redirect URI there. The dashboard requires HTTPS and rejects "localhost", so
# for local dev serve over HTTPS on the loopback IP literal (e.g.
# https://127.0.0.1:5173/) and register that exact URI.
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_SPOTIFY_REDIRECT_URI=

# Google Fonts Developer API key — enables the full searchable font list.
# Get a free key: https://developers.google.com/fonts/docs/developer_api
#   1. Create/select a project in https://console.cloud.google.com/
#   2. Enable the "Web Fonts Developer API"
#   3. Create an API key under "APIs & Services > Credentials"
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key below.
# Without a key the app falls back to a small curated list of popular fonts.
VITE_GOOGLE_FONTS_API_KEY=
